# Project Planning Phase

## Project Title: ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator Using Gemini Models

### 1. Introduction

The project planning phase defines the activities, timeline, resources, and development strategy required to complete the ComicCraft application.

ComicCraft is an AI-powered comic story creator that uses Google Gemini models to generate creative stories, characters, dialogues, and comic panels from user-provided prompts.

The main objective of this phase is to organize the development process, manage resources effectively, and complete the project within the planned schedule.


### 2. Project Objectives

The main objectives of ComicCraft are:

* To develop an AI-based comic story creation application.
* To integrate Gemini models for automated story generation.
* To reduce the time and effort required for manual comic creation.
* To provide a simple and interactive user interface.
* To support comic preview, customization, and export.


### 3. Project Development Plan

The project is divided into the following development stages:

| Phase                   | Activities                                            |
| ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| 1. Requirement Analysis | Identify user needs and system requirements.          |
| 2. Project Design       | Design the architecture, modules, and user interface. |
| 3. Frontend Development | Develop the user interface and input forms.           |
| 4. Backend Development  | Implement application logic and API integration.      |
| 5. AI Integration       | Integrate Gemini models for comic story generation.   |
| 6. Testing              | Test functionality, usability, and error handling.    |
| 7. Deployment           | Deploy the application and prepare documentation.     |


