### 6. Risk Management

| Risk                    | Proposed Solution                                         |
| ----------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |
| Gemini API failure      | Implement error handling and retry options.               |
| API usage limitations   | Monitor API usage and optimize requests.                  |
| Slow story generation   | Optimize prompts and reduce unnecessary API calls.        |
| Inconsistent characters | Maintain consistent character descriptions across panels. |
| Software bugs           | Perform regular testing and debugging.                    |
| Data loss               | Save project data and maintain code backups.              |

